I just downloaded it and compiled it with no problems.  Yea!  The archive
and scripts for the mac were put together very well.

I'm not so sure about the Mac interface so far.  It could be cumbersome on
slower Macs...

If you're going to compile this on your mac, be warned:  You need to allocate
at least 7 (non-virtual) meg to the MPW Shell to compile it.  
(Not easy under the memory hog System 7.)

